*** MISSING >> Pattern Matching for instanceof (Java 16+, standard in 17) - relevant to overriding equals()
    Before:
    public boolean equals(Object obj){
        if(!(obj instanceof MyClass)) return false;
        MyClass other = (MyClass) obj;   // explicit cast needed
        return this.x == other.x;
    }
    Java 17:
    public boolean equals(Object obj){
        if(!(obj instanceof MyClass other)) return false;
        return this.x == other.x;        // no explicit cast needed, "other" auto-bound
    }
    >> cleaner overriding of equals() - very common interview follow-up question after IS-A/overriding topic

